I'll say one other thing as a closing thing to answer your question and a little bit different. The death of a child of one of these people is devastating for not only the family members, but the community and even the country in highly publicized cases. And I've had the opportunity over the years to speak to family members who lost a child. And in particular, you talk about the difference in men and women, in my experience, It particularly seems to affect fathers more than mothers. I mean, they're just so devastated. And I remember one father said to me, I'll never forget it.
在结束回答你的问题时，我想再说一点不同的看法。这些人的孩子死亡对家庭成员、社区甚至在高度公开的案件中对整个国家来说都是毁灭性的。多年来，我有机会与失去孩子的家庭成员交谈。特别是，你谈到男性和女性的区别，根据我的经验，这似乎对父亲的影响比对母亲更大。我的意思是，他们太崩溃了。我记得一位父亲对我说，我永远不会忘记。

